  "content": "<p data-pid=\"qa3mcpeb\">刷到梗图，慕名而来：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-db51c0f2d0bde5ec1c144226d4c1a093_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"566\" data-rawheight=\"579\" data-original-token=\"v2-db51c0f2d0bde5ec1c144226d4c1a093\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"566\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-db51c0f2d0bde5ec1c144226d4c1a093_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;566&#39; height=&#39;579&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"566\" data-rawheight=\"579\" data-original-token=\"v2-db51c0f2d0bde5ec1c144226d4c1a093\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"566\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-db51c0f2d0bde5ec1c144226d4c1a093_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-db51c0f2d0bde5ec1c144226d4c1a093_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"XCb7bu-v\">我也喜欢看百合作品，这里是记录：<a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/1088994950\" data-draft-title=\"我看过的百合向作品+印象（2026-06-07 更新；135 部作品/系列；新增喜欢的画师 23 位）\" class=\"internal\">我看过的百合向作品+印象（2026-06-07 更新；135 部作品/系列；新增喜欢的画师 23 位）</a></p><blockquote data-pid=\"LcOgneYV\">PS：（大佬头像还是《文学少女》的姬仓麻贵，有品位的！我也看《文学少女》，这下共同点又 +1 了，笑死）</blockquote><p data-pid=\"JIZsOQUj\">回归正题：有哪些优秀的百合同人作品？一时间有点难从我的收藏里挑出来，这里就只写点还记得名字的。</p><h2>2026 广州百合 only</h2><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-dfbbaf24382288f55dcd715217b7f09f_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1226\" data-rawheight=\"640\" data-original-token=\"v2-dfbbaf24382288f55dcd715217b7f09f\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1226\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-dfbbaf24382288f55dcd715217b7f09f_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1226&#39; height=&#39;640&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1226\" data-rawheight=\"640\" data-original-token=\"v2-dfbbaf24382288f55dcd715217b7f09f\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1226\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-dfbbaf24382288f55dcd715217b7f09f_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-dfbbaf24382288f55dcd715217b7f09f_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"LbHcg6S3\">里面印象比较深的作品有：</p><ol><li data-pid=\"G5uE9p4K\">《泥嚎！请吃我家产》，原作为《因为女友今天不在》百合 NTR 向作品</li><li data-pid=\"dzuD-26v\">《黑章鱼与冰激凌》，原作为 Ave Mujica</li><li data-pid=\"dNbdOuCH\">《爱音主唱的大修行》，原作为 MyGO</li><li data-pid=\"aAXTDmid\">《记仇狐狸 &amp; 心机狗》，原作为 MyGO</li><li data-pid=\"YNV61Ove\">《理智出逃计划》，原作为《终将成为你》</li><li data-pid=\"-IKnKd2Y\">《就此沉入海中》，原作为《利兹与青鸟》</li><li data-pid=\"zWLEcSNc\">《巧合》，原作为啤酒烧烤（雾</li><li data-pid=\"XWp0mfw_\">《NWE·Sweet as honey》，原作为 love live</li></ol><h2>2025 成都百合 only</h2><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-ea148b797767f5703fd25ae474aef9d7_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"768\" data-rawheight=\"1024\" data-original-token=\"v2-ea148b797767f5703fd25ae474aef9d7\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"768\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-ea148b797767f5703fd25ae474aef9d7_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;768&#39; height=&#39;1024&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"768\" data-rawheight=\"1024\" data-original-token=\"v2-ea148b797767f5703fd25ae474aef9d7\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"768\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-ea148b797767f5703fd25ae474aef9d7_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-ea148b797767f5703fd25ae474aef9d7_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-d8dda73ba5098dc2fcabfc85faad734e_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"768\" data-rawheight=\"1024\" data-original-token=\"v2-d8dda73ba5098dc2fcabfc85faad734e\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"768\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-d8dda73ba5098dc2fcabfc85faad734e_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;768&#39; height=&#39;1024&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"768\" data-rawheight=\"1024\" data-original-token=\"v2-d8dda73ba5098dc2fcabfc85faad734e\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"768\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-d8dda73ba5098dc2fcabfc85faad734e_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-d8dda73ba5098dc2fcabfc85faad734e_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-f16ec035beef8504325629fc672cbca4_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"768\" data-rawheight=\"1024\" data-original-token=\"v2-f16ec035beef8504325629fc672cbca4\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"768\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-f16ec035beef8504325629fc672cbca4_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;768&#39; height=&#39;1024&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"768\" data-rawheight=\"1024\" data-original-token=\"v2-f16ec035beef8504325629fc672cbca4\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"768\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-f16ec035beef8504325629fc672cbca4_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-f16ec035beef8504325629fc672cbca4_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"Hg0qutwC\">里面印象比较深的作品有：</p><ol><li data-pid=\"emubKGHV\">《月之森精神病院》，原作为 Ave Mujica</li><li data-pid=\"5SyETG5x\">《姐妹战争》，原作为《少女与战车》</li><li data-pid=\"R6osWM2j\">《十人十七》，原作为东方 Project</li><li data-pid=\"SHQC74WT\">《モモカ我是OO？真的假的》，原作为 GirlsBandCry</li><li data-pid=\"333-caCh\">《果然，像我这种女人》，原作为孤独摇滚</li></ol><h2>2025 广州百合 only</h2><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-c49d4cbc3d7df1500c544068001e3775_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"2048\" data-rawheight=\"1152\" data-original-token=\"v2-c49d4cbc3d7df1500c544068001e3775\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"2048\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-c49d4cbc3d7df1500c544068001e3775_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;2048&#39; height=&#39;1152&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"2048\" data-rawheight=\"1152\" data-original-token=\"v2-c49d4cbc3d7df1500c544068001e3775\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"2048\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-c49d4cbc3d7df1500c544068001e3775_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-c49d4cbc3d7df1500c544068001e3775_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-ba6b808e1c7542acfa483d22cb2a81b7_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"2048\" data-rawheight=\"1152\" data-original-token=\"v2-ba6b808e1c7542acfa483d22cb2a81b7\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"2048\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-ba6b808e1c7542acfa483d22cb2a81b7_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;2048&#39; height=&#39;1152&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"2048\" data-rawheight=\"1152\" data-original-token=\"v2-ba6b808e1c7542acfa483d22cb2a81b7\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"2048\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-ba6b808e1c7542acfa483d22cb2a81b7_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-ba6b808e1c7542acfa483d22cb2a81b7_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"a28-yaBL\">GirlsBandCry 和孤独摇滚的几个同人本都挺喜欢的，还有恶魔之谜的同人（虽然画师也是南方纯，但是脚本不是原作漫画，所以，也算同人？）</p><h2>2024 广州百合 only</h2><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-b2911304cce834d68d0987d3b38a26f9_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1920\" data-rawheight=\"1440\" data-original-token=\"v2-b2911304cce834d68d0987d3b38a26f9\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1920\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-b2911304cce834d68d0987d3b38a26f9_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1920&#39; height=&#39;1440&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1920\" data-rawheight=\"1440\" data-original-token=\"v2-b2911304cce834d68d0987d3b38a26f9\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1920\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-b2911304cce834d68d0987d3b38a26f9_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-b2911304cce834d68d0987d3b38a26f9_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-6debceee7e0ab6b6d2227723a0a3fb6a_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1920\" data-rawheight=\"1440\" data-original-token=\"v2-6debceee7e0ab6b6d2227723a0a3fb6a\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1920\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-6debceee7e0ab6b6d2227723a0a3fb6a_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1920&#39; height=&#39;1440&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1920\" data-rawheight=\"1440\" data-original-token=\"v2-6debceee7e0ab6b6d2227723a0a3fb6a\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1920\" data-original=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-6debceee7e0ab6b6d2227723a0a3fb6a_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-6debceee7e0ab6b6d2227723a0a3fb6a_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-439b7bda544228d5d726382a22275410_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1920\" data-rawheight=\"1440\" data-original-token=\"v2-439b7bda544228d5d726382a22275410\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" width=\"1920\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-439b7bda544228d5d726382a22275410_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></noscript><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,&lt;svg xmlns=&#39;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&#39; width=&#39;1920&#39; height=&#39;1440&#39;&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;\" data-caption=\"\" data-size=\"normal\" data-rawwidth=\"1920\" data-rawheight=\"1440\" data-original-token=\"v2-439b7bda544228d5d726382a22275410\" class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" width=\"1920\" data-original=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-439b7bda544228d5d726382a22275410_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-actualsrc=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-439b7bda544228d5d726382a22275410_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"mK7Exq4V\">不想打字了，直接看图吧（</p><p data-pid=\"H38rCLq5\">海鸟的本超好看的！</p><h2>相关回答</h2><a href=\"https://www.zhihu.com/question/634671698/answer/2016324338740135220\" data-draft-node=\"block\" data-draft-type=\"link-card\" data-draft-title=\"男生喜欢百合类型的ACG作品很奇怪么？\" data-draft-cover=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-ffb63b4917ee94c45e221c6f0b8b6dbd.png?